<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The status-bar icon for location sharing.

  A map pin, drawn as a flat white silhouette on transparency, because that is
  all Android keeps: from API 21 the small icon is masked to its alpha channel
  and tinted by the system, so any colour put here is thrown away.

  A pin rather than a bike on purpose. The notification is about the phone
  reading a position, not about the delivery, and the icon a rider glances at on
  a lock screen should say the same thing the words under it say.
-->
